docs {
  # Collections

  Needs `rom/01` first (romId). 05 to 12 work on two throwaway MANUAL
  collections created here, never on the demo ones. 10 answers 409
  (NO_PENDING_PROPOSAL): a manual collection has no grouping to accept. 11
  exports the collection through `GET /roms/export`.
}
